= Conclusion and open questions <chap-conclusion>

This kind of chapter can include many different things (or only some of them):

- Discussion of results
- Conclusions from the results or from the process in general
- Open questions for future research, resulting from the research performed or
  from the results obtained

But not things like the bibliography or other back matter which is generated
outside of this chapter.

